Third-party components and references
-------------------------------------

Handy (https://github.com/cjpais/Handy)
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 CJ Pais.
    `crates/maele-core/src/audio_toolkit/` is vendored from Handy's Rust core and
    retains the copyright notice above (see also `crates/maele-core/LICENSE-HANDY`).
    The Handy name, logo, icon, and brand assets are not open-source and are not
    used here; Maele is unaffiliated.

transcribe.cpp / transcribe-cpp (https://github.com/handy-computer/transcribe.cpp)
    MIT License. Used as a library dependency (not vendored) for GGUF inference.

NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 ASR Streaming 0.6B
    Model weights downloaded at runtime are governed by the OpenMDW-1.1 license.
    Used as Maele's English engine.

NB-Whisper (Nasjonalbiblioteket / National Library of Norway)
    https://huggingface.co/NbAiLab/nb-whisper-large — Apache-2.0.
    Model weights downloaded at runtime; used as Maele's Norwegian engine.

OpenAI Whisper (ggml conversions by handy-computer)
    MIT License. The small Whisper GGUF is used for language identification.

TypeSafe Jev (https://docs.typesafe.ai)
    Maele calls the TypeSafe System One API ("Jev") for its routing decisions.
    Jev is a hosted service; no TypeSafe code is vendored here.
